{"sha": "2255934343e1b33dd14f5ec50828767f79e8c765bd3ce032a28bae59ff78a2b9", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "移到别处的原子，其矢量移出了矩阵的对角线，", "对迹没有贡献。留在原位的原子，", "其三个矢量经 $3\\times3$ 矩阵变换，该矩阵由 $R$ 给出，其迹", "在取 $z$ 沿轴的坐标系中计算：旋转时为 $\\cos\\theta + \\cos\\theta + 1$，", "非真旋转时末项变为 $-1$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[振动计数]\\label{prop:b3:group-theory-applied:mode-count}", "$\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{vib}} = \\Gamma_{3N} - \\Gamma_{\\mathrm{trans}} - \\Gamma_{\\mathrm{rot}}$，其中", "$\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{trans}}$ 为 $(x, y, z)$ 的表示，$\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{rot}}$ 为", "$(R_x, R_y, R_z)$ 的表示；非线性分子有 $3N - 6$ 个振动，线性", "分子则为 $3N - 5$ 个。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "这 $3N$ 个位移描述了全部运动：质心的三个", "平动、三个转动（线性分子为两个，因绕自身轴转动", "不使任何原子核移动），以及振动。这些子空间在各操作下", "互不混合，故其表示相加。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[水]\\label{ex:b3:group-theory-applied:water}", "% ledger: vib:H2O.sym, vib:H2O.bend, vib:H2O.asym", "\\ce{H2O} 属 $C_{2v}$，分子位于 $xz$ 平面内。留在原位的原子数为 3、1、3、1；", "$\\chi_{xyz}$：$3, -1, 1, 1$；故 $\\chi_{3N} = 9, -1, 3, 1$。约化得 $3A_1 +", "A_2 + 3B_1 + 2B_2$。平动 $A_1 + B_1 + B_2$ 与转动 $A_2 + B_1 + B_2$", "扣除后，$\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{vib}} = 2A_1 + B_1$。两个 $a_1$ 模式分别是", "对称伸缩（\\qty{3657}{cm^{-1}}）与弯曲（\\qty{1595}{cm^{-1}}）；$b_1$ 模式是", "反对称伸缩（\\qty{3756}{cm^{-1}}）。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, >=Stealth]", "  \\foreach \\x/\\name/\\lab in {0/sym/{$\\nu_1$, $a_1$, symmetric stretch}, 4.3/bend/{$\\nu_2$, $a_1$, bend}, 8.6/asym/{$\\nu_3$, $b_1$, antisymmetric stretch}}{", "    \\begin{scope}[xshift=\\x cm]", "      \\node[aO] (o\\name) at (0,0.35) {};", "      \\node[aH] (a\\name) at (-0.8,-0.25) {};", "      \\node[aH] (b\\name) at (0.8,-0.25) {};", "      \\begin{scope}[on background layer]\\draw[bond] (o\\name.center) -- (a\\name.center) (o\\name.center) -- (b\\name.center);\\end{scope}", "      \\node[anchor=north, align=center, font=\\footnotesize] at (0,-0.9) {\\lab};", "    \\end{scope}}", "  % symmetric stretch: H outward along the bonds, O up a little", "  \\draw[->, omThm, thick] (-0.95,-0.36) -- (-1.42,-0.71);", "  \\draw[->, omThm, thick] (0.95,-0.36) -- (1.42,-0.71);", "  \\draw[->, omThm, thick] (0,0.74) -- (0,0.98);", "  % bend: each H moves perpendicular to its bond, closing the angle; O up", "  \\draw[->, omThm, thick] (4.3-0.92,-0.36) -- (4.3-0.62,-0.76);", "  \\draw[->, omThm, thick] (4.3+0.92,-0.36) -- (4.3+0.62,-0.76);", "  \\draw[->, omThm, thick] (4.3,0.74) -- (4.3,0.98);", "  % antisymmetric stretch: one H out, the other in, O sideways", "  \\draw[->, omThm, thick] (8.6-0.95,-0.36) -- (8.6-1.42,-0.71);", "  \\draw[->, omThm, thick] (8.6+1.02,0.0) -- (8.6+0.70,0.24);", "  \\draw[->, omThm, thick] (8.6-0.05,0.80) -- (8.6+0.25,0.80);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 水的三种简正模式（箭头表示位移，未按比例绘制）。", "两个 $a_1$ 模式保持分子的全部对称性；$b_1$", "模式在 $C_2$ 作用下改变符号。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[另外四种分子]\\label{ex:b3:group-theory-applied:table}", "同样的步骤（在本章的图形数据中计算并核对）", "给出：", "\\begin{center}\\small", "\\begin{tabular}{llll}", "\\hline", "分子 & 点群 & $\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{vib}}$ & 模式数 \\\\ \\hline", "\\ce{NH3} & $C_{3v}$ & $2A_1 + 2E$ & 6 \\\\", "\\ce{CH4} & $T_d$ & $A_1 + E + 2T_2$ & 9 \\\\", "\\ce{CO2} & $D_{\\infty h}$（经 $D_{2h}$）& $\\Sigma_g^+ + \\Sigma_u^+ + \\Pi_u$（$A_g + B_{1u} + B_{2u} + B_{3u}$）& 4 \\\\", "\\ce{BF3} & $D_{3h}$ & $A_1' + 2E' + A_2''$ & 6 \\\\", "\\ce{XeF4} & $D_{4h}$ & $A_{1g} + B_{1g} + B_{2g} + A_{2u} + B_{2u} + 2E_u$ & 9 \\\\", "\\ce{SF6} & $O_h$ & $A_{1g} + E_g + T_{2g} + 2T_{1u} + T_{2u}$ & 15 \\\\ \\hline", "\\end{tabular}", "\\end{center}", "对线性分子，无限群应换为其子群 $D_{2h}$，", "其中简并的 $\\Pi_u$ 弯曲模式分裂为 $B_{2u} + B_{3u}$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{选择定则}", "", "\\begin{definition}[直积]\\label{def:b3:group-theory-applied:direct-product}", "两个表示的\\emph{直积}\\index{直积} $\\Gamma_i\\otimes\\Gamma_j$ 是", "由它们基函数之积所承载的表示，", "其特征标为 $\\chi_i(R)\\chi_j(R)$ 之积。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[积分为零]\\label{thm:b3:group-theory-applied:vanishing-integral}", "对全空间的积分 $\\int f_1f_2f_3\\,\\dd\\tau$ 只有在", "直积 $\\Gamma_1\\otimes\\Gamma_2\\otimes\\Gamma_3$ 含有全", "对称表示时才可能不为零。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "对称操作只是对空间各点重新标记，故积分的值", "在被积函数经任一 $R$ 变换后保持不变。取", "变换后的被积函数在群上的平均：各不可约表示所对应的", "分量的平均为", "$\\frac1h\\sum_R\\hat R(\\cdot)$，它是到全对称", "表示上的投影（\\cref{def:b3:group-theory-applied:projection}，取全部 $\\chi = 1$）。", "其余分量取平均后为零；若乘积不含", "全对称部分，则积分为零。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{definition}[红外活性、拉曼活性]\\label{def:b3:group-theory-applied:activity}", "基频振动若能吸收红外光，则称其为\\emph{红外活性}\\index{红外活性}；", "若其出现在拉曼光谱中，则称其为\\emph{拉曼活性}\\index{拉曼活性}", "（见\\cref{ch:b3:rovibrational-spectroscopy}）。", "\\end{definition}", ""]}